  "Question": "Eight friends ate at a restaurant and agreed to share the bill equally. Because Judi forgot her money, each of her seven friends paid an extra \\(\\$2.50\\) to cover her portion of the total bill. What was the total bill?",
  "Question Type": "text",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "\\(\\$120\\)",
    "B": "\\(\\$128\\)",
    "C": "\\(\\$140\\)",
    "D": "\\(\\$144\\)",
    "E": "\\(\\$160\\)"
  },
  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "C",
  "Solution": "The seven extra payments together cover Judi's entire original share. Therefore her share was\n\\[\n7\\cdot\\$2.50=\\$17.50.\n\\]\nThe bill was originally divided into eight equal shares, including Judi's. Its total was therefore\n\\[\n8\\cdot\\$17.50=\\$140.\n\\]\nThe total bill was \\(\\$140\\), choice C.",
